0..73 Comment "/// This source declares an indexed family whose data block writes a rule"
74..145 Comment "/// over its constructors. One constructor states its index at a field."
146..149 Comment "///"
150..228 Comment "/// It pins the refusal of a constructor rule on such a family. A rule relates"
229..306 Comment "/// two terms at one index. Each checker reads the index of a term that holds"
307..323 Comment "/// no variable."
324..327 Comment "///"
328..408 Comment "/// The lowering reads the rules of a family after the description route. A rule"
409..486 Comment "/// whose left side a constructor heads is refused as `OutOfFragment.Indexed`"
487..565 Comment "/// over its two sides, where a constructor of the family states an index that"
566..584 Comment "/// names a field."
